                  "text": "To commemorate the 183rd birthday of Florence Nightingale, Aga Khan University School of Nursing held its 22nd Lamplighting ceremony at which 95 nurses from BScN and RN Diploma programmes took their pledge to honour the international code of nursing ethics, and to uphold the integrity of the professional nurse",
